<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage falls below 10 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage falls below 10 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage fell to 9.602 billion rand on Saturday from 10.861 billion on Friday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
